d5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499299745_655666927555582_6126808797951872270_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zQLYD6VOHOAQ7kNvwFVXjSQ&_nc_oc=Adp1eF316NtNBW3yejoq3lQo4TJGewczKrlxJ2QDVmlWiIrFzW8Ny07RlKrKtcK6bmk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQFh9nXNJ6Bx7fYmDLKtbhnD9YC_xlBP0ozkujWLnxbgg&oe=6AFDD921"}, {"file_name": "Freefall_Screenshot_01.png", "id": "1237991958094979", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830812_1237991964761645_538112053924044308_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=j8pAXVbakpgQ7kNvwFgdRm3&_nc_oc=Adozi2mMFfsUoo3YboV5RnqP5LvI2EEPh_3tUANMMTHRg5oYRHF8cb96vu8dFIfRE8U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ_chLA-MDdNdP3Al7ZSPouuJysnVKIaigfUGycMoq1tg&oe=6AFDE0D1"}, {"file_name": "Freefall_Screenshot_08.png", "id": "1269574814908444", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298212_1269574818241777_758556989194239379_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=b5I9cWcv8gcQ7kNvwG5GhG8&_nc_oc=Adou7-t9dMptTpjcIXCkgJGSecnR20CMIdJ69Do-wbtZpcDjK2nLvkefg7BROVCFpto&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRFmWneQDhZUYd--Y5beVWCLq31L2JwFok-iTA48CWLHw&oe=6AFDE397"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer-Cover-Freefall-EarliestAccess.png", "id": "1808420356428695", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300661_1808420359762028_6370515042281540577_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=63M23WXK4T0Q7kNvwHZSVM6&_nc_oc=AdpIG-tQubiH1-ng-HJT4kOOG-QyTt04SJCOJs2VHjEJxnh0unx1r5xKyhOy6XG2efc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQySt_FrWyhvW6p_TpqiHxoNrUm-OEHdJ4kjHA0CEjpnQ&oe=6AFDD2DE"}, "display_name": "Project Freefall", "keywords": ["skydiving", "party", "tag", "friends", "free"], "long_description": "Dive into Project Freefall, where the stakes are as high as the altitude. You and up to seven friends are plummeting towards the earth in this adrenaline-pumping game of tag... but there\u2019s only ONE parachute.\n\nThe rules are simple: survive. The parachute drops from the plane. Your job? Skydive out of the plane and grab it for yourself. Toss a grenade, spray a fire extinguisher, or dodge the shark as you weave through the clouds in a high-speed aerial chase where alliances are temporary and gravity is permanent. As the ground rushes up to meet you, the intensity skyrockets. It's a hilarious, high-skill dance of chaos where only one can claim the ultimate victory, leaving the rest to an\u2026 explosive landing.\n\n**FEATURES**\n\n- 8-Player Mayhem: Invite your squad for the ultimate test of friendship and reflexes. More players mean more chaos!\n-  Cross-Platform Play: Dive in from either PC or VR. Everyone plays together in the same sky.\n- In-game Voice Chat: Talk with your friends easily as you plummet through the air.\n- High-Stakes, Simple Rules: Easy to learn, but mastering aerial maneuvers to secure the win at the last second takes true skill.\n- Flex Your Style: Look good while you fall! Shop for unique characters and diver suits to customize your look.\n\n**What are you waiting for? Download for free and join our Discord.**\n\nIt\u2019s a race to the bottom - will you land with a prize or a splat?\n\n{792047206721044}", "short_description": "Grab your squad and dive into a frantic chase for the lone parachute. Project Freefall is the ultimate game of tag at 10,000 feet. Toss a grenade, spray a fire extinguisher, or dodge the shark as you skydive with your friends and try to survive the fall. Will you go on to victory or go splat? Free to play."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://schellgames.com/freefall-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://schellgames.com/freefall-terms-of-use", "publisher_name": "S